sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Venue as Venue
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Venue: changeCapacity(capacity)
    Note over Venue: Policies: venueRead, venueWrite, venueExecute
    Note over Venue: Guards (2)
    Venue->>Venue: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;active#quot;
    Venue->>Venue: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Venue->>Venue: compute.previousCapacity
    Venue->>Venue: mutate.capacity
    Venue->>EventBus: emit VenueCapacityChanged on venue.capacity_changed
    Venue-->>-Client: void